{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t國務院總理李強在結束中俄總理第三十一次定期會晤後，乘坐包機回到北京。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n國務委員兼國務院秘書長吳政隆等陪同人員，同機抵達。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n離開聖彼得堡時，俄羅斯政府高級官員及中國駐俄羅斯大使張漢暉等人，到機場送行。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：羅宇光\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T01:23:11.393527+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T00:49:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T05:58:07.240105+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T01:17:55.522791+00:00","content_hash":"4dc0975781b6e86e554491ce09239fb207111ee2b318dcd51be52ffa217fc6ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}